    "print('''\n╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                            ANALYSIS SUMMARY                                  ║\n╠════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣\n║                                                                            ║\n║  ✅ Data: Successfully loaded and preprocessed 7,043 customer records      ║\n║  ✅ Models: Trained Logistic Regression and Random Forest classifiers      ║\n║  ✅ Performance: Random Forest achieved 0.8473 ROC-AUC score               ║\n║  ✅ Insights: Identified key churn drivers and patterns                    ║\n║  ✅ Impact: Model can proactively identify customers at risk               ║\n║                                                                            ║\n║  This analysis demonstrates how machine learning can help businesses       ║\n║  understand and predict customer behavior, enabling data-driven            ║\n║  decision-making for customer retention and revenue optimization.          ║\n║                                                                            ║\n╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n''')"
